    "detailed_description": "The garden is a wasteland in darkness. Travel all regions and restore it to a tranquil and bright paradise in this puzzle adventure. <br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Puzzle adventure:</strong> Lighthearted story campaign presented as dioramas<br></li><li><strong>Levels:</strong> 8 regions with multiple levels each that expand on mechanics they introduce<br></li><li><strong>Single player:</strong> Colourful sequence of logical and spacial puzzles<br></li><li><strong>2 player co-op:</strong> Both players can solve the same puzzle from different areas simultaneously</li></ul>",
